{
  "scope": "Follow-up to docs/HANDOFF_MIMIC_ACT_ROOT_CAUSE_20260921.md section 12 items 1-6: reproduce the stale reset image path, measure render-only refresh, check re-rendering from stored raw states, compare policy vs. successful demo from an identical initial physics state, and compare action chunk sizes. No training, no dataset regeneration, no modification of existing data or models.",
